syndicate-evacuation-call-title = Extraction contract
syndicate-evacuation-call-prompt = Request extraction? You have one accepted call per shift. The team will stabilize you and take you off the station. Final departure through the extraction console ends play as this character, with no return to the station and no automatic objective completion. The team will not break you out of custody or help with your objectives. Rescue is not guaranteed: the team needs volunteers.
syndicate-evacuation-call-reason = Extract agent {$name}. Locate the patient using your pinpointer, stabilize them and bring them aboard. Complete extraction through the departure console. Do not return the patient to the station or help with their objectives. Withdraw if extraction is impossible. Jailbreaks, revenge and handing out equipment are prohibited.
syndicate-evacuation-role-denied = This contract is only available to an ordinary station Syndicate agent with no additional antagonist roles.
syndicate-evacuation-access = Syndicate extraction team
syndicate-evacuation-job-title = Extraction specialist
syndicate-evacuation-medic-name = Syndicate extraction medic
syndicate-evacuation-medic-description = Find the assigned agent, stabilize them and extract them with your partner. You are here to evacuate one patient.
syndicate-evacuation-escort-name = Syndicate extraction escort
syndicate-evacuation-escort-description = Secure a route to the shuttle, protect the medic and help carry the assigned agent. Leave the station afterward.
syndicate-evacuation-rules =
    You are a [color={ role-type-team-antagonist-color }][bold]{ role-type-team-antagonist-name }[/bold][/color] with a limited task: medical extraction of one assigned agent.
    Find the patient using your pinpointer, treat them and bring them aboard. Complete the mission through the extraction console: the shuttle leaves permanently with everyone aboard. Ensure there are no bystanders aboard. Do not abduct people.
    Your mission does not include assassinations, sabotage, helping with the agent's objectives, revenge or supporting other antagonists. Do not hand out weapons, armor or service equipment. Use medical supplies for treatment.
    Use weapons only to defend against an immediate attack and withdraw. Do not pursue enemies. Do not assault the brig or forcibly free prisoners; withdraw if extraction is impossible.
    Do not return the stabilized patient to the station. Extraction ends the participation of the agent and your team. You may recover the patient's body if they die; you may not continue their objectives.
    You do not remember your previous life or information learned as a ghost. General knowledge of game mechanics is permitted.
